  "content": "## ![](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/989/293/morning-glory-header.png)\n\n ![](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/989/697/cat-good-morning.png)\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong>描述</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">提升您的貓早晨贈禮</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">支援伺服器端。您可以在伺服器上安裝此模組，無需在客戶端安裝。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">由製作 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 的相同作者所開發（若要獲得完整的角色扮演體驗，請取得 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG 模组包</a> 並享受任務與角色扮演玩法）</span></p> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong>特色</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">(因您的經驗將進一步增強，多虧以下功能)&nbsp;</span>  </p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">在原版 Minecraft 中，玩家收到的<a href=\"https://minecraft.fandom.com/wiki/Tutorials/Cat_gift_farming\" rel=\"nofollow\">早晨贈禮</a>可能有限，且很少得到幻肢膜。這會改變貓每天清晨掉落的物品清單，改為更優化的掉落列表。請參照下方您從貓那可獲贈的早晨禮物清單。</span></p> \n\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#0cf;font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong>常見</strong></span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 兔皮</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 兔腳</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 生雞肉</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 羽毛</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 腐肉</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 線</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 幻肢膜</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 西瓜片</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#e67e23;font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong>稍稀有</strong></span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 鑽石</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 金蘋果</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 黃金胡蘿蔔</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 不死图腾</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f0f;font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong>稀有</strong></span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 紫水晶碎片</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 海之心</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 凋靈骷顱頭</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 迴聲碎片</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 海綿</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 試煉鑰匙 (1.21+)</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00;font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong>極其稀有</strong></span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 末地水晶</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 鸚鵡螺殼</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 下界之星</span>  \n<span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- 詛咒瓶 (1.21+)&nbsp;</span> \n\n \n\n<span style=\"font-size:14px\">現在就取得一個伺服器並與朋友一起玩！點擊 <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或使用程式碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 以獲得 25 折優惠！</span>\n\n[![](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png)](https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion)\n\n <p style=\"text-align:center\">[![](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png)](https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ)</p> <p style=\"text-align:center\">[![](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png)](https://ko-fi.com/gamerpotion)</p>",
